{
  "source": "Prompts/what-is-ai-v15.mp4",
  "duration": 163.3066875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.38,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project,"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.74,
      "end": 3.88,
      "text": "but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.62,
      "end": 6.16,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.12,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "Ask your desk, give me 10 ideas for my next history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.46,
      "end": 13.14,
      "text": "Nothing, it's a desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.22,
      "end": 16.46,
      "text": "Ask a friend and they can help you brainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.32,
      "end": 20.5,
      "text": "Ask AI and it can give you a list in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.34,
      "end": 23.22,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 24.84,
      "text": "that used to take a human brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.56,
      "end": 28.66,
      "text": "It can understand a question, summarize a long document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.98,
      "end": 30.46,
      "text": "or translate a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.32,
      "end": 33.46,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it actually thinks like your friend"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.46,
      "end": 36.5,
      "text": "or that all 10 of those history ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.28,
      "end": 40.06,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.06,
      "end": 41.9,
      "text": "that once required a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.98,
      "end": 44.62,
      "text": "Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.24,
      "end": 47.16,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.82,
      "end": 49.42,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down these tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.42,
      "end": 50.76,
      "text": "into two main categories."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.58,
      "end": 53.46,
      "text": "First is recommendation AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.18,
      "end": 56.46,
      "text": "Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.07,
      "end": 59.26,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.26,
      "end": 61.88,
      "text": "and selecting the likely best match for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.52,
      "end": 65.24,
      "text": "You see this every day when you get a suggested Netflix show,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.78,
      "end": 67.62,
      "text": "a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.52,
      "end": 70.0,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.76,
      "end": 72.76,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.46,
      "end": 75.36,
      "text": "The engine behind this creation process"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.36,
      "end": 76.98,
      "text": "is something called a prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.48,
      "end": 79.26,
      "text": "That's simply the specific question"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.26,
      "end": 81.52,
      "text": "or set of instructions you type into the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.16,
      "end": 84.06,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.06,
      "end": 88.58,
      "text": "an essay, an image, a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 91.92,
      "text": "AI left the realm of science fiction years ago"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.92,
      "end": 93.58,
      "text": "to become part of your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.18,
      "end": 95.7,
      "text": "It operates the apps on your phone"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.7,
      "end": 98.28,
      "text": "and powers the tools your first job will hand you"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.28,
      "end": 98.94,
      "text": "on day one."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.6,
      "end": 102.38,
      "text": "Most of what it does today, it will do better tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.84,
      "end": 105.36,
      "text": "This graphic shows a breakdown"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.36,
      "end": 108.64,
      "text": "of exactly where AI already lives in your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.18,
      "end": 110.88,
      "text": "First, it recommends media"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.88,
      "end": 112.72,
      "text": "by predicting what you might like next."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.72,
      "end": 116.02,
      "text": "You interact with this on Spotify, Netflix, and TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.42,
      "end": 119.52,
      "text": "Second, navigation tools predict traffic"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.52,
      "end": 122.5,
      "text": "and your arrival time on apps like Google Maps and Waze."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.46,
      "end": 126.02,
      "text": "Third, face recognition validates your identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.42,
      "end": 127.86,
      "text": "checking whether a face matches you"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.86,
      "end": 129.46,
      "text": "for phone unlocks and photo tagging."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.48,
      "end": 133.32,
      "text": "Fourth, voice assistants turn your speech into words"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.32,
      "end": 135.8,
      "text": "when you talk to Siri, Alexa, or Hey Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.6,
      "end": 140.04,
      "text": "Finally, chatbots carry on direct conversations with you"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.04,
      "end": 143.12,
      "text": "through programs like ChatGPT, Clod, and Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.32,
      "end": 146.92,
      "text": "Looking at this complete picture shows us something clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.72,
      "end": 150.64,
      "text": "AI was already part of your day before chatbots arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.36,
      "end": 154.44,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.34,
      "end": 156.6,
      "text": "You've got a tool that can help."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.06,
      "end": 158.84,
      "text": "Start with something you want to do."
    }
  ],
